end
note 5 & 6. inkling_attn_flash_split_bf16 + inkling_attn_reduce_bf16 (V=2.0, gate=0 -> sigmoid(0)=0.5 -> out=1.0)
ikPtr add wva 0x140000
ikPtr add wva 0x150000
ikPtr add wva 0x170000
ikPtr add wva 0x190000
ikPtr add wva 0x198000
ikPtr add wva 0x199000
ikArg 24
ikArg 8
